{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p13411","chapterId":"s61d5f09691b651b3","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p13411-7f44e77e010efce14038","entryId":"other-interaction-p13411","chapterId":"s61d5f09691b651b3","text":"당신은 이곳에 와본 적이 없음을 거듭 확인하지만, 주변 환경은 마치 집에 돌아온 것 같다","speaker":"","mission":"존재하지 않는 기억","scene":"상호작용 2","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["14288555833708952767"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p13411-32b81c7a0ba9f9f463a4","entryId":"other-interaction-p13411","chapterId":"s61d5f09691b651b3","text":"문득 돌아보니 위엄 있는 장군과 그의 젊은 효위가 보이는 것 같다. 장군은 효위에게 죄수들의 모습을 똑똑히 기억하라고 지시한다. 기억 속에서 과거의 메아리가 서서히 떠오른다……","speaker":"","mission":"존재하지 않는 기억","scene":"상호작용 2","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["14569055160695704592"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p13411-84e65901daec6cf0a499","entryId":"other-interaction-p13411","chapterId":"s61d5f09691b651b3","text":"「사람은 다섯이나, 대가는 셋일지니……」","speaker":"","mission":"존재하지 않는 기억","scene":"상호작용 2","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["6331924850148982742"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"interaction-p13411","title":"존재하지 않는 기억","page":"不存在的记忆","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-interaction-p13411-7f44e77e010efce14038","rowId":"other-interaction-p13411-7f44e77e010efce14038","missionId":"interaction-p13411","mission":"존재하지 않는 기억","sceneId":"s61d5f09691b651b3","scene":"상호작용 2","contextId":"wiki-context-9c31c55e4d8d588bbac5e199","page":"不存在的记忆","revision":42922,"location":[1,0],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":[],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-interaction-p13411-32b81c7a0ba9f9f463a4","rowId":"other-interaction-p13411-32b81c7a0ba9f9f463a4","missionId":"interaction-p13411","mission":"존재하지 않는 기억","sceneId":"s61d5f09691b6